        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Géza von Cziffra, Henry Selick\n- Works: The Queen of the Landstrasse, The Nightmare Before Christmas, James and the Giant Peach, Coraline\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, producer, writer, stop motion director\n- Places: Hungary, Austria, America\n\nFacts:\n- Géza von Cziffra was born on 19 December 1900 and died on 28 April 1989.\n- Géza von Cziffra was a Hungarian and Austrian film director and screenwriter.\n- The Queen of the Landstrasse is a 1948 Austrian romance film directed by Géza von Cziffra.\n- The Queen of the Landstrasse stars Angelika Hauff, Rudolf Prack, and Hermann Erhardt.\n- Henry Selick was born on November 30, 1952.\n- Henry Selick is an American stop motion director, producer, and writer.\n- Henry Selick is best known for directing The Nightmare Before Christmas, James and the Giant Peach, and Coraline.",
